window.__kcChunk("repo_cloud_skills_study_main",{"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_README_md":"<h1>Cloud Skills Study</h1>\n<p>云计算技能竞赛学习</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1\">CS Project Status</a></p>\n<h2>CS</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Week 1</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_DNS_md\" class=\"inlink\">Week 2</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_DNS-RECORDS_md\" class=\"inlink\">Week 3</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_NAT_md\" class=\"inlink\">Week 4</a></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">OS</a></h3>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_README_md":"<h1>OS</h1>\n<h2>0 概述</h2>\n<h3>[第1章] 关于本书的对话</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78684399\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">[第2章] 操作系统概述</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78684446\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h2>I 虚拟化</h2>\n<h3>[[第3章] 关于虚拟化的对话]</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78684733\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"\">[第4章] 进程的概念</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78684767\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"\">[第5章] 插曲：进程 API</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78685238\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"\">[第6章] 受限直接执行原理（Limited Direct Execution）</a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78685673\">项目卡片</a></p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_README_md":"<h1>关于 OS</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[第2章] 操作系统概述</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78684446\">项目卡片</a></p>\n<h2>虚拟化 CPU</h2>\n<h3>单处理器</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o cpu.o cpu.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./cpu.o &quot;A&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<h3>多处理器</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o cpu.o cpu.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./cpu.o A &amp; ./cpu.o B &amp; ./cpu.o C &amp; ./cpu.o D\n</code></pre>\n<h2>虚拟化内存</h2>\n<h3>单个</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o mem.o mem.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./mem.o\n</code></pre>\n<h3>多个</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o mem.o mem.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./mem.o &amp; ./mem.o\n</code></pre>\n<h2>多线程</h2>\n<h3>循环 1000 次</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o thread.o thread.c -Wall -lpthread\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./thread.o 1000\n</code></pre>\n<h3>循环 100000 次</h3>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o thread.o thread.c -Wall -lpthread\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./thread.o 100000\n</code></pre>\n<h2>输入/输出</h2>\n<p><strong>编译</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o io.o io.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>执行</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./io.o\ncat /tmp/file\n</code></pre>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_README_md":"<h1>作业</h1>\n<h2>问题 1</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个调用 <code>fork()</code> 的程序。在调用 <code>fork()</code> 之前，主进程访问变量（例如 <code>x</code>）并给变量赋值（例如 <code>100</code>）。子进程中该变量的值是什么？父进程和子进程修改变量 <code>x</code> 之后，变量发生了怎样的变化？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h1.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;main process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int x = 100;\n\n    printf(&quot;main process' X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;child process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n        printf(&quot;child process' X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n\n        x = 200;\n        printf(&quot;child process change X from 100 to 200\\n&quot;);\n    } else {\n        printf(&quot;parent process of %d (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, (int)getpid());\n        printf(&quot;parent process' X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h1.o h1.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>main process (pid:614)\nmain process' X is... 100\nparent process of 615 (pid:614)\nparent process' X is... 100\nchild process (pid:615)\nchild process' X is... 100\nchild process change X from 100 to 200\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>由于非确定性（nondeterminism），很难确认变量是否发生了变化。</p>\n<h2>问题 2</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个使用 <code>open()</code> 系统调用打开文件的程序，并调用 <code>fork()</code> 来创建新进程。子进程和父进程能否访问由 <code>open()</code> 返回的文件描述符？父进程和子进程能否同时向文件写入？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h2.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;main process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int f_descripter = open(&quot;./h2.out&quot;, O_CREAT | O_WRONLY | O_TRUNC, S_IRWXU);\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        char text[] = &quot;here is the child process\\n&quot;;\n\n        if(write(f_descripter, text, sizeof(text)) == -1) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;write failed on child process\\n&quot;);\n        }\n    } else {\n        char text[] = &quot;here is the parent process\\n&quot;;\n\n        if(write(f_descripter, text, sizeof(text)) == -1) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;write failed on parent process\\n&quot;);\n        }\n    }\n\n    close(f_descripter);\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h2.o h2.c -Wall\n./h2.o\ncat h2.out\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>here is the parent process\nhere is the child process\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>父进程和子进程都可以访问文件描述符，并且可以同时向文件写入。</p>\n<h2>问题 3</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写另一个使用 <code>fork()</code> 的程序。子进程应输出 \"hello\"，父进程应输出 \"goodbye\"。请让子进程始终先输出。父进程不调用 <code>wait()</code> 能实现吗？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h3.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;child (pid:%d) : hello\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        // with wait\n        printf(&quot;parent %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d) : goodbye\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n\n        // without wait\n        // printf(&quot;parent %d (pid:%d) : goodbye\\n&quot;, rc, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h3.o h3.c -Wall\n./h3.o\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>child (pid:2213) : hello\nparent 2213 (pid:2212) : goodbye\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>由于非确定性，父进程若不调用 <code>wait()</code>，就无法保证子进程始终先输出。</p>\n<p>不过，如果父进程调用 <code>wait()</code>，则子进程必定先执行。</p>\n<h2>问题 4</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个调用 <code>fork()</code> 并调用 <code>exec()</code> 系列函数来执行 <code>/bin/ls</code> 的程序。请尝试是否可以使用 <code>exec()</code> 的所有变体 <code>execl()</code>、<code>execle()</code>、<code>execlp()</code>、<code>execv()</code>、<code>execvp()</code>、<code>execve()</code>。请思考为什么执行相同功能的系统调用基本上会有多个变体。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h4.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        char *execv_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execv&quot;, 0};\n        char *execvp_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execvp&quot;, 0};\n        char *execve_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execve&quot;, 0};\n\n        // execl(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execl&quot;, 0);\n        // execle(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execle&quot;, 0);\n        // execlp(&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execle&quot;, 0);\n        // execv(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, execv_data);\n        // execvp(&quot;echo&quot;, execvp_data);\n        // execve(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, execve_data, 0);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h4.o h4.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果（execl）</h3>\n<pre><code>execl\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p><code>exec()</code> 的所有变体都可以使用。不过，由于它并不会创建新进程，所以后面的调用不会返回。</p>\n<p>关于 <code>exec()</code> 各变体的说明如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>l：在传递 char* 类型的 argv 参数时使用。</li>\n<li>v：在传递 char*[] 类型的 argv 参数时使用。</li>\n<li>e：在传递环境变量时使用。</li>\n<li>p：参照环境变量 PATH。无需输入绝对路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>问题 5</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个使用 <code>wait()</code> 等待子进程结束的程序。<code>wait()</code> 返回的是什么？如果子进程调用 <code>wait()</code>，会发生什么结果？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h5.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;child (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n\nint rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h5.o h5.c -Wall\n./h5.o\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>child (rc_wait:-1) (pid:2416)\nparent of 2416 (rc_wait:2416) (pid:2415)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>调用 <code>wait()</code> 时，成功则返回 PID，失败则返回 -1。</p>\n<p>子进程调用 <code>wait()</code> 时，由于没有子进程的子进程，因此返回 -1。</p>\n<h2>问题 6</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修改上述问题中编写的程序，将 <code>wait()</code> 替换为 <code>waitpid()</code>。在什么情况下使用 <code>waitpid()</code> 更好？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h6.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        int rc_wait = waitpid(rc, NULL, 0);\n\n        printf(&quot;child (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = waitpid(rc, NULL, 0);\n\n        printf(&quot;parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h6.o h6.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>child (rc_wait:-1) (pid:2577)\nparent of 2577 (rc_wait:2577) (pid:2576)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p><code>waitpid()</code> 比 <code>wait()</code> 可以指定更多的选项。</p>\n<p>此外，还可以更详细地指定要等待的子进程。</p>\n<h2>问题 7</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个程序，创建一个子进程，并让子进程关闭标准输出（STDOUT_FILENO）。子进程关闭标准输出后，如果为了输出而调用 <code>printf()</code>，会发生什么？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h7.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        close(STDOUT_FILENO);\n\n        printf(&quot;call printf() on child\\n&quot;);\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;call printf() on parent\\n&quot;);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h7.o h7.c -Wall\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<pre><code>call printf() on parent\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>如果子进程关闭了标准输出，那么在子进程中即使调用 <code>printf()</code> 也不会有任何反应。</p>\n<p>但是，在父进程中则可以正常调用。</p>\n<h2>问题 8</h2>\n<h3>问题</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>编写一个程序，创建两个子进程，并使用 <code>pipe()</code> 系统调用将一个子进程的标准输出连接到另一个子进程的输入。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/cloud-skills-study-main/cs/os/virtualization/process_api/homework/h8.c）\" >代码</a></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int first_rc = fork();\n    int second_rc = fork();\n    int f_description;\n    int buf = 0;\n\n    if(first_rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(first_rc == 0) {\n        pipe(f_description);\n\n        write(f_description, 1, sizeof(int));\n\n        if(second_rc &lt; 0) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n            exit(1);\n        } else if(second_rc == 0) {\n            read(f_description, buf, sizeof(int));\n            printf(&quot;%d&quot;, buf);\n        } else {\n            int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n        }\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编译与执行</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">gcc -o h8.o h8.c -Wall\n./h8.o\n</code></pre>\n<h3>结果</h3>\n<p>无输出。</p>\n<h3>结论</h3>\n<p>失败。在不调用 <code>pipe()</code> 的情况下，如何实现两个进程之间的传递，我还没有完全理解。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_README_md":"<h1>作业 1</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-76465253\">Project</a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_linked-list_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Linked List</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_stack_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Stack</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_queue_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Queue</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_tree_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Tree</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_graph_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Graph</a></h2>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_graph_README_md":"<h1>Graph</h1>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>Graph 是一种由\"顶点（Vertex）\"和\"边（Edge）\"组成的数据结构。</p>\n<p>它表示顶点之间的组织结构图。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Graph\" src=\"../img/graph.png\" /></p>\n<h3>顶点（Vertex）</h3>\n<p>顶点是图中类似节点的一个位置。</p>\n<h3>边（Edge）</h3>\n<p>边是顶点之间的关系。</p>\n<h2>时间复杂度（邻接矩阵图）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>最佳</th>\n<th>最差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找（两个节点）</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找（从一个节点出发的所有节点）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_linked-list_README_md":"<h1>链表</h1>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>链表是一种线性的数据结构集合。</p>\n<p>每个节点包含数据以及一个指向下一个节点的指针。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"链表\" src=\"../img/linked_list.png\" /></p>\n<p>与数组不同，链表可以在中间位置插入和删除数据。</p>\n<h2>时间复杂度</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>最佳</th>\n<th>最差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_queue_README_md":"<h1>Queue</h1>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>Queue 是计算机中维护数据的一种数据结构。</p>\n<p>Queue 是一种 <strong>先进先出（First-In-First-Out，FIFO）</strong> 的数据结构。最先加入队列的数据将最先被移除。</p>\n<p><strong>Enqueue</strong> 指向队列中添加新数据。</p>\n<p><strong>Dequeue</strong> 指从队列中移除前端的数据。</p>\n<h3>线性队列</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"Linear Queue\" src=\"../img/linear_queue.png\" /></p>\n<p>线性队列易于实现，但会浪费内存。</p>\n<h3>循环队列</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"Circular Queue\" src=\"../img/circular_queue.png\" /></p>\n<p>循环队列克服了线性队列的缺点。循环队列不存在内存浪费。</p>\n<h2>时间复杂度</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>最佳</th>\n<th>最差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_stack_README_md":"<h1>Stack</h1>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>Stack 是计算机中维护数据的一种数据结构。</p>\n<p>Stack 是一种 <strong>后进先出（Last-In-First-Out，LIFO）</strong> 的数据结构。最先加入栈的数据将最后被移除。</p>\n<p><strong>Push</strong> 指向栈中添加新数据。</p>\n<p><strong>Pop</strong> 指从栈中移除最后的数据。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Stack\" src=\"../img/stack.png\" /></p>\n<h2>时间复杂度</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>最佳</th>\n<th>最差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_tree_README_md":"<h1>树</h1>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>树是一种图。多个节点不能指向同一个节点。</p>\n<p>它被称为“树”，是因为可视化后看起来与树相似。</p>\n<p>它是用于搜索的高效数据结构之一。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"树\" src=\"../img/tree.png\" /></p>\n<h3>前序遍历</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>访问节点。</li>\n<li>前序遍历左子树。</li>\n<li>前序遍历右子树。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>中序遍历</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>中序遍历左子树。</li>\n<li>访问节点。</li>\n<li>中序遍历右子树。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>后序遍历</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>后序遍历左子树。</li>\n<li>访问节点。</li>\n<li>后序遍历右子树。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>时间复杂度（二叉搜索树）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>最佳</th>\n<th>最坏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_DNS_md":"<h1>DNS</h1>\n<p>DNS（Domain Name System）负责将域名转换为 IP 地址。</p>\n<p>要连接到特定的计算机，我们需要知道它的 IP 地址。</p>\n<p>但人们无法理解 IP 地址。</p>\n<p>因此，DNS 将域名转换为 IP 地址。</p>\n<p>最终，人们可以使用域名来代替 IP 地址。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"DNS Diagram\" src=\"img/dns-diagram.png\" /></p>\n<h2>Route 53</h2>\n<p>Amazon Route 53 是由 AWS 管理的一种 DNS Web 服务。</p>\n<p>我们不需要管理 DNS 服务器，因为 AWS 会替我们管理。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_IP-ADDRESS-AND-SUBNETTING_md":"<h1>IP 地址与子网划分</h1>\n<p>IP 地址（Internet Protocol Address）是网络设备之间的一种特殊编号。</p>\n<h2>IPv4</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>211.45.27.231</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>IPv4 地址的大小为 32 位。理论上 IPv4 的范围为 4,294,967,296 个地址。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>起始地址</th>\n<th>结束地址</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Class A</td>\n<td>0.0.0.0</td>\n<td>127.255.255.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class B</td>\n<td>128.0.0.0</td>\n<td>191.255.255.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class C</td>\n<td>192.0.0.0</td>\n<td>223.255.255.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class D</td>\n<td>224.0.0.0</td>\n<td>239.255.255.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class E</td>\n<td>240.0.0.0</td>\n<td>255.255.255.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Class D 仅用于组播，Class E 仅用于研究。</p>\n<h2>IPv6</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>2001:0db8:85a3:08d3:1319:8a2e:0370:7334</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>IPv6 是下一代互联网协议。IPv4 已经耗尽，因此他们制定了新的标准。</p>\n<p>它的大小为 128 位。理论上 IPv6 的范围为 340,282,366,920,938,463,463,374,607,431,768,211,456 个地址。</p>\n<h2>子网划分</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>一种按需求划分网络的技术。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ol>\n<li>效率：划分 IP 地址以防止浪费。</li>\n<li>性能：减小网络广播规模以提升性能。</li>\n<li>安全：由于我们划分了网络，因此提升了安全性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>示例</h3>\n<p>IP 地址：192.168.0.1</p>\n<p>子网掩码：255.255.255.0(/24)</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位</th>\n<th>IP 地址范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0 ~ 31</td>\n<td>192.168.0.1 ~ 192.168.0.31</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32 ~ 63</td>\n<td>192.168.0.32 ~ 192.168.0.63</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64 ~ 95</td>\n<td>192.168.0.64 ~ 192.168.0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>96 ~ 127</td>\n<td>192.168.0.96 ~ 192.168.0.127</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>128 ~ 159</td>\n<td>192.168.0.128 ~ 192.168.0.159</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>160 ~ 191</td>\n<td>192.168.0.160 ~ 192.168.0.191</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>192 ~ 223</td>\n<td>192.168.0.192 ~ 192.168.0.223</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>224 ~ 255</td>\n<td>192.168.0.224 ~ 192.168.0.255</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>网络地址：192.168.0.1</p>\n<p>广播地址：192.168.0.255</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_OSI-7-LAYERS_md":"<h1>OSI 7 层</h1>\n<h2>什么是 OSI 7 层？</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>开放系统互连（Open Systems Interconnection）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>OSI 7 层（又称 OSI 模型）描述了计算机系统通过网络进行通信所使用的七个层。</p>\n<p>每一层只使用下一层的功能，并为上一层提供功能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>第 7 层</td>\n<td>应用层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 6 层</td>\n<td>表示层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 5 层</td>\n<td>会话层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 4 层</td>\n<td>传输层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3 层</td>\n<td>网络层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层</td>\n<td>数据链路层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>物理层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>各层</h2>\n<h3>物理层</h3>\n<p>物理层负责网络中的物理连接。它由网络硬件传输技术组成。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"网线\" src=\"img/physics-layer-lan-cable.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>数据链路层</h3>\n<p>数据链路层负责使用物理层连接网络上的外围设备。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分配地址</strong>：从物理层分配网络设备上的许多信号。</li>\n<li><strong>检测错误</strong>：检测信号传输过程中的错误。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img alt=\"网桥\" src=\"img/data-link-layer-bridge.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>这是一个 <code>Bridge</code>。它是数据链路层的典型设备。<code>L2 Switch</code> 是数据链路层的另一种设备。</p>\n<h3>网络层</h3>\n<p>网络层负责包括路由在内的<em>数据包转发</em>。</p>\n<p><strong>什么是 <em>数据包转发</em>？</strong></p>\n<p>数据包转发是利用输入数据包的头部信息将数据包发送到最终网络的步骤。</p>\n<p>IPv4、PIv6 是网络层的典型协议。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"路由器\" src=\"img/network-layer-router.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>这是网络层的典型设备。</p>\n<h2>传输层</h2>\n<p>传输层负责提供通信服务以连接发送方和接收方。</p>\n<p>传输层提供可靠性、流量控制。</p>\n<p>TCP（Transmission Control Protocol）和 UDP（User Datagram Protocol）是传输层的典型协议。</p>\n<h2>会话层</h2>\n<p>会话层负责建立、维护、同步和终止最终用户应用程序之间的会话。</p>\n<p>会话层为会话连接提供身份验证和权限。</p>\n<p>H.245、NetBIOS、RPC 是会话层的典型协议。</p>\n<h2>表示层</h2>\n<p>表示层负责网络中的数据转换。</p>\n<p>它提供数据转换、数据压缩、加密和解密。</p>\n<p>SSL（Secure Socket Layer）是表示层的典型协议。</p>\n<h2>应用层</h2>\n<p>应用层是用于通过网络进行进程之间连接的抽象层。</p>\n<p>许多协议都包含在应用层中。</p>\n<p>例如，SSH、HTTP、SMTP 是应用层的典型协议。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_README_md":"<h1>作业 2</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-77299899\">Project</a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_OSI-7-LAYERS_md\" class=\"inlink\">OSI 7 Layers</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_IP-ADDRESS-AND-SUBNETTING_md\" class=\"inlink\">IP Address and Subnetting</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_ROUTING_md\" class=\"inlink\">Routing</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_DNS_md\" class=\"inlink\">DNS</a></h2>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week2_ROUTING_md":"<h1>Routing</h1>\n<p><img alt=\"Routing\" src=\"img/routing-transit.png\" /></p>\n<p>Routing 是为网络或跨多个网络中的流量选择路径的过程。</p>\n<p>最佳路径即最短距离或最少时间。</p>\n<p>路由器（Router）是执行路由的设备。</p>\n<p>路由器使用\"路由协议（Routing Protocol）\"计算最佳路径，并保存在\"路由表（Routing Table）\"中。</p>\n<h2>传送方案</h2>\n<p>有 4 种路由方案：\n1. Unicast（单播）：<strong>一对一</strong>\n2. Broadcast（广播）：<strong>一对所有</strong>\n3. Multicast（组播）：<strong>一对多</strong> 或 <strong>多对多</strong>\n4. Anycast（任播）：<strong>多者中的一对一</strong></p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_DNS-RECORDS_md":"<h1>DNS Records</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>DNS 各记录的类型与概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>A Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IPv4 地址。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>AAAA Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IPv6 地址。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>CNAME Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>将域名或子域名转发到另一个域名。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>MX Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>邮件交换。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>TXT Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>管理员在记录中存储文本备注。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>NS Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>名称服务器。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>SOA Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>关于域名的管理信息。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>SRV Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>为特定服务指定端口。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>PTR Record</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在反向查询中提供域名。</p>\n</blockquote>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_DNS-VS-IP-IN-LINUX-PC_md":"<h1>Linux PC 中 DNS 与 IP 的对比</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在 Linux PC 中，是否可以优先于 DNS 的结果值，为特定域名设置 IP？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>1. 之前</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">ping -c 4 sjlee0416.com\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"Before\" src=\"img/dns-vs-ip-in-linux-pc-1.png\" /></p>\n<p>无法找到 sjlee0416.com 的 IP 地址。</p>\n<h2>2. 编辑 <code>hosts</code> 文件</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">vi /etc/hosts\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"Edit hosts file\" src=\"img/dns-vs-ip-in-linux-pc-2.png\" /></p>\n<p>添加 <code>10.10.10.10 sjlee0416.com</code>。</p>\n<h2>3. 之后</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">ping -c 4 sjlee0416.com\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"After\" src=\"img/dns-vs-ip-in-linux-pc-3.png\" /></p>\n<p>PING 尝试将数据包发送到 <code>10.10.10.10</code>。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_EC2-BIND9_md":"<h1>EC2 bind9</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在实际 EC2 服务器上安装 bind9 并配置 DNS 服务器</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>OS</h2>\n<p>Ubuntu 20.04</p>\n<h2>安装和设置 DNS 服务器</h2>\n<h3>安装 bind9</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\"># DNS 服务器\n\nsudo su\napt update -y\napt upgrade -y\napt install -y bind*\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/etc/hosts</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\"># DNS 服务器\n\nvi /etc/hosts\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">127.0.0.1 localhost\n127.0.1.1 ns.test.dns\n172.31.8.83 ns.test.dns\n\n# 以下行对于支持 IPv6 的主机是理想的\n::1 ip6-localhost ip6-loopback\nfe00::0 ip6-localnet\nff00::0 ip6-mcastprefix\nff02::1 ip6-allnodes\nff02::2 ip6-allrouters\nff02::3 ip6-allhosts\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/etc/hostname</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\"># DNS 服务器\n\nvi /etc/hostname\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">ns.test.dns\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/etc/bind/named.conf.options</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">vi /etc/bind/named.conf.options\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">options {\n    directory &quot;/var/cache/bind&quot;;\n    dnssec-validation auto;\n    auth-nxdomain no;\n    listen-on port 53 { localhost; 172.31.0.0; };\n    allow-query { any; };\n    forwarders { 8.8.8.8; };\n    recursion yes;\n};\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/etc/bind/named.conf.local</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">vi /etc/bind/named.conf.local\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">zone &quot;test.dns&quot; IN {\ntype master;\nfile &quot;test.dns.zone&quot;;\n};\n\nzone &quot;0.31.172.in-addr-arpa&quot; IN {\ntype master;\nfile &quot;test.dns.zone.rev&quot;;\n};\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/var/cache/bind/test.dns.zone</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">vi /var/cache/bind/test.dns.zone\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">$TTL    86400\n@       IN      SOA     ns.test.dns.    root.ns.test.dns.(\n                                        1\n                                        604800\n                                        86400\n                                        2419200\n                                        86400 )\n@       IN      NS      ns.test.dns.\nns      IN      A       172.31.8.83\n</code></pre>\n<h3>编辑 <code>/var/cache/bind/test.dns.zone.rev</code></h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">vi /var/cache/bind/test.dns.zone.rev\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-editorconfig\">$TTL    86400\n@       IN      SOA     ns.test.dns.    root.ns.test.dns.(\n2\n604800\n86400\n2419200\n86400 )\n@       IN      NS      ns.\n83      IN      PTR     ns.test.dns.\n</code></pre>\n<h3>重启 bind9</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">systemctl restart bind9\n</code></pre>\n<h2>使用 <code>nslookup</code> 和 <code>dig</code> 进行测试</h2>\n<h3>nslookup</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">nslookup ns.test.dns\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"nslookup\" src=\"img/ec2-bind9-1.png\" /></p>\n<h3>dig</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">dig ns.test.dns\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"dig\" src=\"img/ec2-bind9-2.png\" /></p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_HUB-VS-SWITCH_md":"<h1>Hub vs Switch</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>通过 Hub 连接各 PC 与通过 Switch 连接各 PC 的性能差异</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Hub</h2>\n<p><img alt=\"Hub\" src=\"img/switch-vs-hub-1.png\" /></p>\n<p>同一时间只能有一个端口进行通信。</p>\n<h2>Switch</h2>\n<p><img alt=\"Switch\" src=\"img/switch-vs-hub-2.png\" /></p>\n<p>每个端口都可以独立通信。</p>\n<h2>结果</h2>\n<p>Switch 的性能优于 Hub。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_IPV4-PRIVATE-ADDRESS_md":"<h1>IPv4 Private Address</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IPv4 标准下 Private A、B、C 类地址</p>\n</blockquote>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>起始地址</th>\n<th>结束地址</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>10.0.0.0</td>\n<td>10.255.255.255</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>172.16.0.0</td>\n<td>172.31.255.255</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>192.168.0.0</td>\n<td>192.168.255.255</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_MY-PC-TO-NETFLIX_md":"<h1>从我的 PC 到 NETFLIX</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>从我的 PC 访问 Netflix 时一定需要路由器吗？</p>\n<p>当数据包准确传送到 Netflix 服务器时，如何找到目的地？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>路由器？</h2>\n<p><strong>是。</strong></p>\n<p>路由器用于为网络内或跨多个网络的流量选择路径。</p>\n<p>因此，我们需要路由器来使用互联网。</p>\n<p>事实上，我们通常已经在使用路由器。由于 Wi-Fi，我们已经在使用家用路由器（例如 ipTime）。</p>\n<p>互联网由许多网络的连接组成。</p>\n<p>因此，从发送方到接收方存在许多路径。</p>\n<p>在这里，选择正确的路径就是 ROUTING。</p>\n<h2>查找 IP</h2>\n<p>为了将数据包从我们发送到 Netflix，我们需要知道 Netflix 服务器的 IP。</p>\n<p>它们已经使用域名（netflix.com），因此我们可以使用 DNS 找到 IP。</p>\n<h2>投递</h2>\n<p>如果我们知道服务器的 IP，就可以向服务器发送数据包。</p>\n<p>服务器也可能使用路由器。因此，数据包将通过路由协议从我们的路由器发送到服务器的路由器。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_QUERY-COM_md":"<h1>查询 Naver.com</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>查询 naver.com 时，是否总是调用 .com 域名服务器？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>不是！因为我们有缓存数据！</strong></p>\n<p>客户端向 DNS 服务器请求服务器的 IP。\n如果该 DNS 服务器已经缓存了该服务器 IP 的相关数据，DNS 就会将缓存数据提供给客户端。</p>\n<p>但如果 DNS 没有缓存数据，它就应该向域名服务器发起请求。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_README_md":"<h1>作业 3</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-77639616\">Project</a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_HUB-VS-SWITCH_md\" class=\"inlink\">Hub 与 Switch</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>通过 Hub 连接各 PC 与通过 Switch 连接各 PC 的性能差异</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_TCP-3-STEP_md\" class=\"inlink\">TCP 3 步</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 的连接建立阶段为什么由 3 个步骤组成？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_SUBNETTING-31-HOSTS_md\" class=\"inlink\">为 31 台主机进行 10.0.0.0/8 子网划分</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>将 10.0.0.0/8 网络进行子网划分，以便可供 31 台主机使用</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_IPV4-PRIVATE-ADDRESS_md\" class=\"inlink\">IPv4 私有地址</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IPv4 标准下 Private A、B、C 类地址</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_ROUTING-PROTOCOL_md\" class=\"inlink\">路由</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>路由器中可配置的路由方法类型和代表性路由协议</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_MY-PC-TO-NETFLIX_md\" class=\"inlink\">我的 PC 到 NETFLIX</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>从我的 PC 访问 Netflix 时一定需要路由器吗？</p>\n<p>当数据包准确传送到 Netflix 服务器时，如何找到目的地？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_QUERY-COM_md\" class=\"inlink\">查询 Naver.com</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>查询 naver.com 时总是会调用 .com 名称服务器吗？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_DNS-VS-IP-IN-LINUX-PC_md\" class=\"inlink\">Linux PC 中的 DNS 与 IP</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在 Linux PC 中，是否可以优先于 DNS 结果值为特定域名配置 IP？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_TCP-AND-LINUX-NETWORK-SOCKET_md\" class=\"inlink\">TCP 与 Linux 网络套接字</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在 TCP 环境中的数据传输过程</p>\n<p>Linux 中各网络套接字的状态</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_DNS-RECORDS_md\" class=\"inlink\">DNS 记录</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>DNS 各记录的类型和概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_EC2-BIND9_md\" class=\"inlink\">EC2 bind9</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在实际 EC2 服务器上安装 bind9 并配置 DNS 服务器</p>\n</blockquote>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_ROUTING-PROTOCOL_md":"<h1>路由</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>路由器中可配置的路由方法类型和代表性路由协议</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>静态 vs 动态</h2>\n<h3>静态路由</h3>\n<p>管理员设置路由信息。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong></p>\n<p>它比动态路由更快。\n路由器没有压力，因为它只参考管理员设置的路由信息。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong></p>\n<p>无法主动更改路由信息，并且管理员必须了解网络运维。</p>\n<h3>动态路由</h3>\n<p>路由器自动交换网络信息。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong></p>\n<p>管理员只需进行初始设置。\n路由器相互发送和接收路由信息，并自动设置路由表</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong></p>\n<p>比静态路由占用更多路由器内存。</p>\n<h2>IGP VS EGP</h2>\n<h3>IGP</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>内部网关协议</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>IGP 是一种关于域内部路径的路由协议。</p>\n<h3>EGP</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>外部网关协议</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>EGP 是一种关于系统之间交换路径设置信息的路由协议。\nEGP 的目的是安全和控制。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_SUBNETTING-31-HOSTS_md":"<h1>为 31 台主机划分子网</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>将 10.0.0.0/8 网络划分子网，使 31 台主机可用</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>我们需要 31 台主机，外加网关 IP。</p>\n<h2>现状</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IP 地址</th>\n<th>子网掩码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>10.0.0.0</td>\n<td>255.0.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>00001010.00000000.00000000.00000000</td>\n<td>11111111.00000000.00000000.00000000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>子网划分</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子网划分</th>\n<th>IP 地址</th>\n<th>分配对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>10.0.0.0/26</td>\n<td>10.0.0.0</td>\n<td>网络地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>10.0.0.1 ~ 10.0.0.62</td>\n<td>主机 IP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>10.0.0.63</td>\n<td>广播地址</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_TCP-3-STEP_md":"<h1>TCP 3 步</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 的连接建立阶段为什么由 3 个步骤组成？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>什么是 TCP 连接建立 3 步？</h2>\n<p><strong>又名 3 次握手</strong></p>\n<h3>SYN</h3>\n<p>客户端向服务器发送 SYN 数据包。</p>\n<h3>SYN-ACK</h3>\n<p>服务器向客户端响应 SYN-ACK 数据包。</p>\n<h3>ACK</h3>\n<p>客户端向服务器发送 ACK 数据包。</p>\n<h2>为什么？</h2>\n<p>TCP 是双向协议。</p>\n<p>客户端应证明它可以从服务器接收数据包。</p>\n<p>同样，<strong>服务器也应证明它可以向客户端发送数据包。</strong></p>\n<p>2 次握手无法建立连接。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_TCP-AND-LINUX-NETWORK-SOCKET_md":"<h1>TCP 与 Linux 网络套接字</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在 TCP 环境中的数据传输过程</p>\n<p>Linux 中各网络套接字的状态</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>TCP</h2>\n<h3>连接建立</h3>\n<p>客户端可以通过使用 3 步握手发起主动打开来建立连接。</p>\n<p><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week3_TCP-3-STEP_md\" class=\"inlink\">什么是 3 步握手？</a></p>\n<h3>数据传输</h3>\n<p>一个进程将 <code>Segment</code> 传输给另一个进程。该段具有序列号和数据。</p>\n<h3>连接终止</h3>\n<p>连接终止阶段使用 4 步握手，连接的每一方独立终止。</p>\n<p>4 步握手使用 FIN 和 ACK。</p>\n<h3>Linux 中的套接字</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">netstat\n</code></pre>\n<p>你可以使用 <code>netstat</code> 命令监控套接字状态。</p>\n<p>如果找不到 netstat 命令，请使用包管理器安装 <code>net-tools</code>。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">yum install -y net-tools\n</code></pre>\n<p><img alt=\"netstat\" src=\"img/tcp-and-linux-network-socket-1.png\" /></p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_NAT_md":"<h1>NAT</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>NAT 的概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>什么是 NAT？</h2>\n<p>NAT（Network Address Translation）是一种地址转换服务。</p>\n<p>它是一种利用路由器等 NAT 硬件将私有 IP 转换为公有 IP 的技术。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"NAT\" src=\"img/nat.png\" /></p>\n<h2>为什么要使用 NAT？</h2>\n<p><strong>1. 节省公有 IP</strong></p>\n<p>公有 IP 是有限的。因此，我们使用 NAT 来节省公有 IP。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 安全性</strong></p>\n<p>从外部网络无法访问内部网络。NAT 硬件可以是防火墙或路由器。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_NETWORK-TROUBLESHOOTING_md":"<h1>网络故障排查</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>可用于网络故障排查的工具、用法与示例</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>命令</h2>\n<h3><code>netstat</code></h3>\n<p><code>netstat -sp tcp</code></p>\n<p><img alt=\"netstat -sp tcp\" src=\"img/network-troubleshooting-1.png\" /></p>\n<p><code>netstat -ano</code></p>\n<p><img alt=\"netstat -ano\" src=\"img/network-troubleshooting-2.png\" /></p>\n<h3><code>nslookup</code></h3>\n<p><code>nslookup -type=ns samsung.com</code></p>\n<p><img alt=\"nslookup -type=ns samsung.com\" src=\"img/network-troubleshooting-3.png\" /></p>\n<h3><code>dig</code></h3>\n<p><code>dig samsung.com</code></p>\n<p><img alt=\"dig samsung.com\" src=\"img/network-troubleshooting-4.png\" /></p>\n<h2>工具</h2>\n<h3>Wireshark</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"Wireshark\" src=\"img/network-troubleshooting-5.png\" /></p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_PORT-FORWARDING_md":"<h1>端口转发</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>端口转发的概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>什么是端口转发？</h2>\n<p>端口转发是一种高级的 NAT。</p>\n<p>它会在跨越路由器或防火墙等网络网关时，把网络请求（包含 IP 地址和端口号）转发到另一端。</p>\n<h2>我们为什么要使用端口转发？</h2>\n<p>端口转发使得公网计算机能够连接到 LAN 中的某台特定计算机。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_README_md":"<h1>作业 4</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jennas-Lee/cloud-skills-study/projects/1#card-78057279\">Project</a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_ROUTING-TYPE_md\" class=\"inlink\">Routing Type</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>路由的类型与特点（rip、ospf、bgp、static 等）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_NAT_md\" class=\"inlink\">NAT</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>NAT 的概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_PORT-FORWARDING_md\" class=\"inlink\">Port Forwarding</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>端口转发（Port Forwarding）的概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_TCP-4-HANDSHAKE_md\" class=\"inlink\">TCP 4 Handshake</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 4 次握手中 Linux socket 的 close wait 与 time wait 的区别，以及各阶段可能出现的问题</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_TCP-3-HANDSHAKE_md\" class=\"inlink\">TCP 3 Handshake</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 3 次握手在首次尝试连接时发生的问题</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_NETWORK-TROUBLESHOOTING_md\" class=\"inlink\">Network Troubleshooting</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>可用于网络故障排查的工具与使用方法、示例</p>\n</blockquote>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_ROUTING-TYPE_md":"<h1>路由类型</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>路由的种类与特点（rip、ospf、bgp、static 等）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>RIP</h2>\n<h3>关于 RIP</h3>\n<p>RIP（Routing Information Protocol，路由信息协议）是<strong>动态路由协议（Dynamic Routing Protocol）</strong>中的一种协议。</p>\n<p>它是一种<strong>距离矢量（Distance Vector）</strong>路由协议。它基于距离（跳数）和方向来发送数据包。</p>\n<p>它属于 IGP 协议，最多允许 15 跳。</p>\n<h3>优点</h3>\n<p>它在小规模网络中效率较高，且占用的内存等资源较少。</p>\n<p>它是标准路由协议，所有路由器都支持。</p>\n<h3>缺点</h3>\n<p>由于不考虑链路速度和延迟，数据包路径可能不是最优的。</p>\n<p>如果没有让所有路由器同步，数据包路径可能会不合适。</p>\n<h2>OSPF</h2>\n<h3>关于 OSPF</h3>\n<p>OSPF（Open Shortest Path First，开放最短路径优先）是<strong>动态路由协议</strong>中的一种协议。</p>\n<p>它使用 <strong>Dijkstra 算法</strong>发送数据包。</p>\n<h3>优点</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>快速重收敛（Fast Reconvergence）</li>\n<li>增量更新（Partial Update）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>缺点</h3>\n<p>与其他路由协议相比，它的配置更为复杂。</p>\n<p>它会占用内存、CPU 等大量资源。</p>\n<h2>BGP</h2>\n<h3>关于 BGP</h3>\n<p>BGP（Border Gateway Protocol，边界网关协议）是一种 EGP 协议。它在各路由器之间交换路由信息。</p>\n<p>它是为大规模网络互联而设计的。</p>\n<h3>优点</h3>\n<p>它能够确保路由不会陷入无限循环。</p>\n<p>它支持 CIDR。</p>\n<h3>缺点</h3>\n<p>连接不同的 AS 需要经过多跳。</p>\n<h2>STATIC</h2>\n<h3>关于静态路由</h3>\n<p>由管理员手动设置路由路径。</p>\n<h3>优点</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可靠性</li>\n<li>安全性</li>\n<li>占用资源少</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>缺点</h3>\n<p>修改配置较为困难，且扩展性较差。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_TCP-3-HANDSHAKE_md":"<h1>TCP 三次握手</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 三次握手中首次尝试连接时出现的问题</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>超时</h2>\n<p>超时是指等待接收 ACK 数据包的时间限制。</p>\n<h2>SYN 标志位</h2>\n<p>如果主机发送的是连续的序列号（而不是随机数），另一台主机就可能识别出上一次连接的数据包。</p>\n<p>因此，主机会将随机数设置为 ISN。</p>\n<h2>对方没有响应。</h2>\n<p><strong>防火墙</strong></p>\n<p>我们应使用 <code>netstat</code> 检查网络状态。</p>\n<h2>服务器没有响应，但状态却是 ESTABLISHED。</h2>\n<p>我们应检查 <strong>Accept Code</strong>。</p>\n<p>因为我们已经成功连接到了服务器。</p>","github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_TCP-4-HANDSHAKE_md":"<h2><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week4_TCP-4-HANDSHAKE_md\" class=\"inlink\">TCP 四次握手</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>TCP 四次握手中 Linux socket 的 close wait 与 time wait 的区别，以及各阶段可能出现的问题</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>CLOSE_WAIT vs TIME_WAIT</h2>\n<h3>Active Close vs Passive Close</h3>\n<p><strong>Active Close</strong>：请求断开 TCP 的一方。</p>\n<p><strong>Passive Close</strong>：响应断开 TCP 的一方。</p>\n<h3>CLOSE_WAIT</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Passive Close 转变为 CLOSE_WAIT。</li>\n<li>Passive Close 命令使用该 TCP 端口的进程终止。</li>\n<li>Passive Close 等待直到执行 'close'。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>TIME_WAIT</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Active Close 对 FIN 包请求 ACK。</li>\n<li>Active Close 在 240 秒后断开连接。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>TCP 四次握手问题</h2>\n<h3>SYN Flag</h3>\n<p>如果主机发送连续的序列号（而非随机数），另一台主机可能会识别出先前连接的包。</p>\n<p>因此，主机会为 ISN 设置随机数。</p>\n<h3>TIME_WAIT</h3>\n<p>由于路由延迟或丢包，ACK 包可能在 FIN 包之后才被接收。</p>\n<p>因此，Active Close 会等待 240 秒以接收 ACK 包。</p>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_deployment_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;project version=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;component name=&quot;PublishConfigData&quot; remoteFilesAllowedToDisappearOnAutoupload=&quot;false&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;serverData&gt;\n      &lt;paths name=&quot;user@10.0.0.6:22 password&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;serverdata&gt;\n          &lt;mappings&gt;\n            &lt;mapping local=&quot;$PROJECT_DIR$&quot; web=&quot;/&quot; /&gt;\n          &lt;/mappings&gt;\n        &lt;/serverdata&gt;\n      &lt;/paths&gt;\n    &lt;/serverData&gt;\n  &lt;/component&gt;\n&lt;/project&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_discord_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;project version=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;component name=&quot;DiscordProjectSettings&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;option name=&quot;show&quot; value=&quot;PROJECT_FILES&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;option name=&quot;description&quot; value=&quot;&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;/component&gt;\n&lt;/project&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_inspectionProfiles_Project_Default_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;component name=&quot;InspectionProjectProfileManager&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;profile version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;option name=&quot;myName&quot; value=&quot;Project Default&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;inspection_tool class=&quot;PyBroadExceptionInspection&quot; enabled=&quot;false&quot; level=&quot;WEAK WARNING&quot; enabled_by_default=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;inspection_tool class=&quot;PyPep8Inspection&quot; enabled=&quot;true&quot; level=&quot;WEAK WARNING&quot; enabled_by_default=&quot;true&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;option name=&quot;ignoredErrors&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;list&gt;\n          &lt;option value=&quot;E266&quot; /&gt;\n        &lt;/list&gt;\n      &lt;/option&gt;\n    &lt;/inspection_tool&gt;\n    &lt;inspection_tool class=&quot;PyPep8NamingInspection&quot; enabled=&quot;true&quot; level=&quot;WEAK WARNING&quot; enabled_by_default=&quot;true&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;option name=&quot;ignoredErrors&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;list&gt;\n          &lt;option value=&quot;N802&quot; /&gt;\n          &lt;option value=&quot;N803&quot; /&gt;\n        &lt;/list&gt;\n      &lt;/option&gt;\n    &lt;/inspection_tool&gt;\n    &lt;inspection_tool class=&quot;PyUnresolvedReferencesInspection&quot; enabled=&quot;true&quot; level=&quot;WARNING&quot; enabled_by_default=&quot;true&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;option name=&quot;ignoredIdentifiers&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;list&gt;\n          &lt;option value=&quot;django.contrib.auth.models.User.*&quot; /&gt;\n        &lt;/list&gt;\n      &lt;/option&gt;\n    &lt;/inspection_tool&gt;\n  &lt;/profile&gt;\n&lt;/component&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_inspectionProfiles_profiles_settings_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;component name=&quot;InspectionProjectProfileManager&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;settings&gt;\n    &lt;option name=&quot;USE_PROJECT_PROFILE&quot; value=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;version value=&quot;1.0&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;/settings&gt;\n&lt;/component&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_misc_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;project version=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;component name=&quot;ProjectRootManager&quot; version=&quot;2&quot; project-jdk-name=&quot;Python 3.9&quot; project-jdk-type=&quot;Python SDK&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;/project&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_modules_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;project version=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;component name=&quot;ProjectModuleManager&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;modules&gt;\n      &lt;module fileurl=&quot;file://$PROJECT_DIR$/.idea/cloud-skills-study.iml&quot; filepath=&quot;$PROJECT_DIR$/.idea/cloud-skills-study.iml&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;/modules&gt;\n  &lt;/component&gt;\n&lt;/project&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main__idea_vcs_xml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;\n&lt;project version=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;component name=&quot;VcsDirectoryMappings&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;mapping directory=&quot;$PROJECT_DIR$&quot; vcs=&quot;Git&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;/component&gt;\n&lt;/project&gt;</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_common_h":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#ifndef __common_h__\n#define __common_h__\n\n#include &lt;sys/time.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/stat.h&gt;\n#include &lt;assert.h&gt;\n\ndouble GetTime() {\n    struct timeval t;\n    int rc = gettimeofday(&amp;t, NULL);\n    assert(rc == 0);\n    return (double) t.tv_sec + (double) t.tv_usec/1e6;\n}\n\nvoid Spin(int howlong) {\n    double t = GetTime();\n    while ((GetTime() - t) &lt; (double) howlong)\n\t; // do nothing in loop\n}\n\n#endif // __common_h__</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_cpu_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/time.h&gt;\n#include &lt;assert.h&gt;\n#include &quot;common.h&quot;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    if(argc != 2) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;usage: cpu &lt;string&gt;\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    }\n\n    char *str = argv[1];\n\n    while(1) {\n        Spin(1);\n        printf(&quot;%s\\n&quot;, str);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_io_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;assert.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/types.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int fd = open(&quot;/tmp/file&quot;, O_WRONLY | O_CREAT | O_TRUNC, S_IRWXU);\n\n    assert(fd &gt; -1);\n\n    int rc = write(fd, &quot;hello, world\\n&quot;, 13);\n    \n    assert(rc == 13);\n    close(fd);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_mem_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &quot;common.h&quot;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int *p = malloc(sizeof(int));\n\n    assert(p != NULL);\n    printf(&quot;(%d) memory adress of p: %p\\n&quot;, getpid(), (unsigned) p);\n\n    *p = 0;\n\n    while(1) {\n        Spin(1);\n        *p = *p + 1;\n        printf(&quot;(%d) p: %d\\n&quot;, getpid(), *p);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_intro_introduction_thread_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &quot;common.h&quot;\n\nvolatile int counter = 0;\nint loops;\n\nvoid *worker(void *arg) {\n    int i;\n    for(i = 0; i &lt; loops; i++) {\n        counter++;\n    }\n\n    return NULL;\n}\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    if(argc != 2) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;usage: threads &lt;value&gt;\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    }\n\n    loops = atoi(argv[1]);\n    pthread_t p1, p2;\n    printf(&quot;Initial value : %d\\n&quot;, counter);\n\n    pthread_create(&amp;p1, NULL, worker, NULL);\n    pthread_create(&amp;p2, NULL, worker, NULL);\n    pthread_join(p1, NULL);\n    pthread_join(p2, NULL);\n\n    printf(&quot;Final value : %d\\n&quot;, counter);\n    \n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h1_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;main process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int x = 100;\n\n    printf(&quot;main process&#x27; X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;child process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n        printf(&quot;child process&#x27; X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n        \n        x = 200;\n        printf(&quot;child process change X from 100 to 200\\n&quot;);\n    } else {\n        printf(&quot;parent process of %d (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, (int)getpid());\n        printf(&quot;parent process&#x27; X is... %d\\n&quot;, x);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h2_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;main process (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int f_descripter = open(&quot;./h2.out&quot;, O_CREAT | O_WRONLY | O_TRUNC, S_IRWXU);\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        char text[] = &quot;here is the child process\\n&quot;;\n\n        if(write(f_descripter, text, sizeof(text)) == -1) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;write failed on child process\\n&quot;);\n        }\n    } else {\n        char text[] = &quot;here is the parent process\\n&quot;;\n\n        if(write(f_descripter, text, sizeof(text)) == -1) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;write failed on parent process\\n&quot;);\n        }\n    }\n\n    close(f_descripter);\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h3_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;child (pid:%d) : hello\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        // with wait\n        printf(&quot;parent %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d) : goodbye\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n\n        // without wait\n        // printf(&quot;parent %d (pid:%d) : goodbye\\n&quot;, rc, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h4_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        char *execv_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execv&quot;, 0};\n        char *execvp_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execvp&quot;, 0};\n        char *execve_data[] = {&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execve&quot;, 0};\n\n        // execl(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execl&quot;, 0);\n        // execle(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execle&quot;, 0);\n        // execlp(&quot;echo&quot;, &quot;echo&quot;, &quot;execle&quot;, 0);\n        // execv(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, execv_data);\n        // execvp(&quot;echo&quot;, execvp_data);\n        // execve(&quot;/bin/echo&quot;, execve_data, 0);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h5_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;child (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h6_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        int rc_wait = waitpid(rc, NULL, 0);\n        \n        printf(&quot;child (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = waitpid(rc, NULL, 0);\n\n        printf(&quot;parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h7_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        close(STDOUT_FILENO);\n\n        printf(&quot;call printf() on child\\n&quot;);\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;call printf() on parent\\n&quot;);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_homework_h8_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int first_rc = fork();\n    int second_rc = fork();\n    int f_description;\n    int buf = 0;\n\n    if(first_rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(first_rc == 0) {\n        pipe(f_description);\n\n        write(f_description, 1, sizeof(int));\n        \n        if(second_rc &lt; 0) {\n            fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n            exit(1);\n        } else if(second_rc == 0) {\n            read(f_description, buf, sizeof(int));\n            printf(&quot;%d&quot;, buf);\n        } else {\n            int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n        }\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_p1_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;hello world (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;hello. I am child (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        printf(&quot;hello, I am parent of %d (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_p2_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;hello world (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;hello. I am child (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;hello, I am parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_p3_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    printf(&quot;hello world (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        printf(&quot;hello. I am child (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, (int)getpid());\n\n        char *myargs[3];\n\n        myargs[0] = strdup(&quot;wc&quot;);\n        myargs[1] = strdup(&quot;p3.c&quot;);\n        myargs[2] = NULL;\n\n        execvp(myargs[0], myargs);\n        printf(&quot;this shouldn&#x27;t print out&quot;);\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n\n        printf(&quot;hello, I am parent of %d (rc_wait:%d) (pid:%d)\\n&quot;, rc, rc_wait, (int)getpid());\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_os_virtualization_process_api_p4_c":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\n#include &lt;string.h&gt;\n#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;\n#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;\n#include &lt;sys/wait.h&gt;\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n    int rc = fork();\n\n    if(rc &lt; 0) {\n        fprintf(stderr, &quot;fork failed\\n&quot;);\n        exit(1);\n    } else if(rc == 0) {\n        close(STDOUT_FILENO);\n        open(&quot;./p4.out&quot;, O_CREAT | O_WRONLY | O_TRUNC, S_IRWXU);\n\n        char *myargs[3];\n\n        myargs[0] = strdup(&quot;wc&quot;);\n        myargs[1] = strdup(&quot;p3.c&quot;);\n        myargs[2] = NULL;\n\n        execvp(myargs[0], myargs);\n    } else {\n        int rc_wait = wait(NULL);\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_graph_graph_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Graph\n# Jennas Lee\n\n\n# Adjacency Metrix Graph\nclass Graph:\n    # 5 nodes graph\n    graph = [[] for tmp in range(5)]\n\n    # add\n    def append(self, first_node, second_node, weight):\n        self.graph[first_node].append([second_node, weight])\n        self.graph[second_node].append([first_node, weight])\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;Graph&quot;)\n    # queue data structure\n    graph = Graph()\n\n    graph.append(1, 2, 3)\n    graph.append(1, 3, 5)\n    graph.append(3, 4, 2)\n    graph.append(3, 5, 4)\n    graph.append(4, 5, 6)\n    #        (3)\n    #     1 ----- 2\n    #     |\n    # (5) |\n    #     |  (2)\n    #     3 ----- 4\n    #      \\     /\n    #   (4) \\   / (6)\n    #        \\ /\n    #         5\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_linked-list_linked_list_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Linked List\n# Jennas Lee\n\nclass Node:\n    num = None\n    next = None\n\n    def __init__(self, num):\n        self.num = num\n\n\nclass LinkedList:\n    head = None\n\n    # insert last node\n    def append(self, num):\n        # first insert\n        if self.head is None:\n            self.head = Node(num)\n\n        else:\n            cursor = self.head\n\n            # search last node\n            while cursor.next:\n                cursor = cursor.next\n\n            cursor.next = Node(num)\n\n    def get(self, index):\n        count = 0\n        node = self.head\n\n        # search index node\n        while count &lt; index:\n            count += 1\n            node = node.next\n\n        return node\n\n    def insert(self, index, num):\n        new_node = Node(num)\n\n        # insert head of linked list\n        if index == 0:\n            new_node.next = self.head\n            # change previous head to new node\n            self.head = new_node\n\n            return\n\n        else:\n            node = self.get(index - 1)\n\n            # swap node\n            next_node = node.next\n            node.next = new_node\n            new_node.next = next_node\n\n    def delete(self, index):\n        # delete head node\n        if index == 0:\n            self.head = self.head.next\n\n            return\n\n        else:\n            node = self.get(index - 1)\n            node.next = node.next.next\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;LINKED LIST&quot;)\n    # linked list data structure\n    linked_list = LinkedList()\n\n    while True:\n        print(&quot;\\n1 : APPEND | 2 : INSERT | 3 : GET | 4 : DELETE | 0 : EXIT&quot;)\n        cmd_code = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a command code... &quot;))\n\n        # exit\n        if cmd_code == 0:\n            print(&quot;EXIT LINKED LIST PROGRAM&quot;)\n            break\n\n        # append\n        elif cmd_code == 1:\n            append_num = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a number which you append in linked list... &quot;))\n\n            print(&quot;APPEND!&quot;, append_num)\n\n            linked_list.append(append_num)\n\n        # insert\n        elif cmd_code == 2:\n            insert_index = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a INDEX number which you insert in linked list... &quot;))\n            insert_num = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a number which you insert in linked list... &quot;))\n\n            print(&quot;INSERT!&quot;, insert_num, &quot;(INDEX :&quot;, insert_index, &quot;)&quot;)\n\n            linked_list.insert(insert_index, insert_num)\n\n        # get\n        elif cmd_code == 3:\n            get_index = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a INDEX number which you get in linked list... &quot;))\n\n            print(&quot;GET!&quot;, linked_list.get(get_index).num, &quot;(INDEX :&quot;, get_index, &quot;)&quot;)\n\n        # delete\n        elif cmd_code == 4:\n            delete_index = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a INDEX number which you delete in linked list... &quot;))\n\n            linked_list.delete(delete_index)\n\n            print(&quot;DELETE! (INDEX :&quot;, delete_index, &quot;)&quot;)\n\n        # wrong\n        else:\n            print(&quot;YOU ENTER A WRONG NUMBER!&quot;)\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_queue_circular_queue_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Queue(Circular Queue)\n# Jennas Lee\n\nclass CircularQueue:\n    QUEUE_SIZE = 10\n    queue_array = list()\n    front = 0\n    back = 0\n    size = 0\n\n    # init queue size\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.queue_array = list(range(self.QUEUE_SIZE))\n\n    def enqueue(self, enqueue_num):\n\n        # queue is full\n        if self.size == self.QUEUE_SIZE:\n            return &#x27;&#x27;\n\n        # queue is not full\n        else:\n            self.queue_array[self.back] = enqueue_num\n            self.back = (self.back + 1) % self.QUEUE_SIZE\n            self.size += 1\n\n    def dequeue(self):\n\n        # queue is empty\n        if self.size == 0:\n            return &#x27;&#x27;\n\n        # queue is not empty\n        else:\n            dequeue_num = self.queue_array[self.front]\n            self.front = (self.front + 1) % self.QUEUE_SIZE\n            self.size -= 1\n\n            return dequeue_num\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;CIRCULAR QUEUE&quot;)\n    # queue data structure\n    queue = CircularQueue()\n\n    while True:\n        print(&quot;\\n1 : ENQUEUE | 2 : DEQUEUE | 0 : EXIT&quot;)\n        cmd_code = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a command code... &quot;))\n\n        # exit\n        if cmd_code == 0:\n            print(&quot;EXIT QUEUE PROGRAM&quot;)\n            break\n\n        # enqueue\n        elif cmd_code == 1:\n            enqueue_num = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a number which you enqueue in queue... &quot;))\n\n            # queue is full\n            if queue.enqueue(enqueue_num) == &#x27;&#x27;:\n                print(&quot;QUEUE IS FULL!&quot;)\n\n            # queue is not full\n            else:\n                print(&quot;ENQUEUE!&quot;, enqueue_num)\n\n        # dequeue\n        elif cmd_code == 2:\n            dequeue_num = queue.dequeue()\n\n            # queue is empty\n            if dequeue_num == &#x27;&#x27;:\n                print(&quot;THERE&#x27;S NO NUMBER TO DEQUEUE!&quot;)\n\n            # queue is not empty\n            else:\n                print(&quot;DEQUEUE!&quot;, dequeue_num)\n\n        # wrong\n        else:\n            print(&quot;YOU ENTER A WRONG NUMBER!&quot;)\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_queue_linear_queue_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Queue(Linear Queue)\n# Jennas Lee\n\nclass LinearQueue:\n    queue_array = []\n    front = 0\n    back = 0\n\n    def enqueue(self, enqueue_num):\n\n        self.queue_array.append(enqueue_num)\n        self.back += 1\n\n    def dequeue(self):\n\n        # queue is empty\n        if self.front == self.back:\n            return &#x27;&#x27;\n\n        # queue is not empty\n        else:\n            self.front += 1\n            return self.queue_array[self.front - 1]\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;LINEAR QUEUE&quot;)\n    # queue data structure\n    queue = LinearQueue()\n\n    while True:\n        print(&quot;\\n1 : ENQUEUE | 2 : DEQUEUE | 0 : EXIT&quot;)\n        cmd_code = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a command code... &quot;))\n\n        # exit\n        if cmd_code == 0:\n            print(&quot;EXIT QUEUE PROGRAM&quot;)\n            break\n\n        # enqueue\n        elif cmd_code == 1:\n            enqueue_num = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a number which you enqueue in queue... &quot;))\n\n            print(&quot;ENQUEUE!&quot;, enqueue_num)\n\n            queue.enqueue(enqueue_num)\n\n        # dequeue\n        elif cmd_code == 2:\n            dequeue_num = queue.dequeue()\n\n            # empty\n            if dequeue_num == &#x27;&#x27;:\n                print(&quot;THERE&#x27;S NO NUMBER TO DEQUEUE!&quot;)\n\n            # not empty\n            else:\n                print(&quot;DEQUEUE!&quot;, dequeue_num)\n\n        # wrong\n        else:\n            print(&quot;YOU ENTER A WRONG NUMBER!&quot;)\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_stack_stack_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Stack\n# Jennas Lee\n\nclass Stack:\n    stack_array = []\n\n    def push(self, push_num):\n        self.stack_array.append(push_num)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        # stack is empty\n        if len(self.stack_array) &lt;= 0:\n            return &#x27;&#x27;\n        # stack is not empty\n        else:\n            return self.stack_array.pop()\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;STACK&quot;)\n    # stack data structure\n    stack = Stack()\n\n    while True:\n        print(&quot;\\n1 : PUSH | 2 : POP | 0 : EXIT&quot;)\n        cmd_code = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a command code... &quot;))\n\n        # exit\n        if cmd_code == 0:\n            print(&quot;EXIT STACK PROGRAM&quot;)\n            break\n\n        # push\n        elif cmd_code == 1:\n            push_num = int(input(&quot;Plz enter a number which you push in stack... &quot;))\n\n            print(&quot;PUSH!&quot;, push_num)\n\n            stack.push(push_num)\n\n        # pop\n        elif cmd_code == 2:\n            pop_num = stack.pop()\n\n            # empty\n            if pop_num == &#x27;&#x27;:\n                print(&quot;THERE&#x27;S NO NUMBER TO POP!&quot;)\n            # not empty\n            else:\n                print(&quot;POP!&quot;, pop_num)\n\n        # wrong\n        else:\n            print(&quot;YOU ENTER A WRONG NUMBER!&quot;)\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>","github-repos_cloud-skills-study-main_cs_week1_tree_binary_tree_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># CS - Data Structure - Tree(Binary Tree)\n# Jennas Lee\n\nclass Node:\n    num = None\n    left = None\n    right = None\n\n    def __init__(self, num):\n        self.num = num\n\n\nclass Tree:\n    root = None\n\n    # 전위 순회\n    def preOrder(self, node):\n        print(node.num, end=&#x27; &#x27;)\n\n        if node.left:\n            self.preOrder(node.left)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n        if node.right:\n            self.preOrder(node.right)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n    # 중위 순회\n    def inOrder(self, node):\n        if node.left:\n            self.preOrder(node.left)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n        print(node.num, end=&#x27; &#x27;)\n\n        if node.right:\n            self.preOrder(node.right)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n    # 후위 순회\n    def postOrder(self, node):\n        if node.left:\n            self.preOrder(node.left)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n        if node.right:\n            self.preOrder(node.right)\n        else:\n            pass\n\n        print(node.num, end=&#x27; &#x27;)\n\n    # make tree\n    def make(self, node, left, right):\n        if self.root is None:\n            self.root = node\n        else:\n            pass\n\n        node.left = left\n        node.right = right\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(&quot;BINARY TREE&quot;)\n    # queue data structure\n    tree = Tree()\n\n    node_list = [Node(i) for i in range(1, 8)]\n\n    # make tree using 1 to 7\n    for i in range(int(len(node_list) / 2)):\n        tree.make(node_list[i], node_list[i * 2 + 1], node_list[i * 2 + 2])\n    #      1\n    #   2     3\n    # 4  5   6  7\n\n    print(&#x27;PRE ORDER&#x27;)\n    tree.preOrder(tree.root)\n    print()\n\n    print(&#x27;IN ORDER&#x27;)\n    tree.inOrder(tree.root)\n    print()\n\n    print(&#x27;POST ORDER&#x27;)\n    tree.postOrder(tree.root)\n    print()\n\n\nif __name__ == &#x27;__main__&#x27;:\n    main()\n</pre>"});